# Global Project Architecture & Context

## Monorepo Layout & Responsibilities
- `web/`: Next.js (App Router), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Shadcn UI.
- `backend/`: Python FastAPI microservice, Celery task workers, Redis message queue, Trafilatura scraping.
- `extension/`: Chrome Extension (Manifest V3) for single-click URL ingestion.
- `supabase/`: PostgreSQL schema migrations, RLS policies, `pg_cron` jobs, and `pgvector` indexes.
- `Plan/`: Master PRD, milestone plans, and roadmap specifications.
- `Documentation/`: API documentation, implementation logs, and architectural runbooks.

## Source of Truth
- Always anchor schema and feature implementations to `Requirments/Smart_Bookmark_Manager_Master_PRD.md`.
- Never invent database columns or modify data contracts without updating the documentation in `Plan/`.